[158.001949, "o", "abilityTest.test_invalid_batch_size) ... usage: reindex.worker [-h] [--source SOURCE] [--index-dir INDEX_DIR]\r\n                      [--checkpoint CHECKPOINT] [--batch-size BATCH_SIZE]\r\n                      [--status]\r\nreindex.worker: error: --batch-size must be positive\r\nok\r\ntest_legacy_checkpoint_is_rebuilt_not_trusted (test_durability.WorkerDurabilityTest.test_legacy_checkpoint_is_rebuilt_not_trusted) ... ok\r\ntest_repeated_partial_batch_stops_then_resume (test_durability.WorkerDurabilityTest.test_repeated_partial_batch_stops_then_resume) ... ok\r\ntest_stop_and_resume_gives_complete_index (test_reindex.ResumeTest.test_stop_and_resume_gives_complete_index) ... ok\r\ntest_rows_round_trip_across_shards (test_reindex.StoreTest.test_rows_round_trip_across_shards) ... ok\r\ntest_empty_body (test_reindex.TransformTest.test_empty_body) ... ok\r\ntest_golden_row (test_reindex.TransformTest.test_golden_row) ... ok\r\n\r\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\nRan 15 tests in 10.822s\r\n\r\nOK\r\n"]
